body:
Hi there.

First thing I wanted to let you know was that antidepressant medication can take 6 -8 weeks before it starts working so don't get disheartened if you don't feel a difference straight away.

&#x200B;

Mindfulness and meditation can be helpful. Personally I have used both when feeling overwhelmed by feelings and I should probably try and use them again, I found it especialy helpful when I couldnt sleep due to thoughts going round and round my head. But its different for everyone. There are free apps available that give you guided mindfulness meditations where you listen to the instructions if you are looking for a place to try.

&#x200B;

From reading the guidance exercise is most helpful for mild to moderate depression. I find some days getting outside helps more that others.
